# This file follows the Citation File Format (https://citation-file-format.github.io/).
# `version` must track CMakeLists.txt's `project(LiPolGen VERSION ...)` -- the
# single source of truth pyproject.toml already reads with a regex
# (`[tool.scikit-build.metadata.version]`); this file has no build step of its
# own, so a version bump there must be copied here by hand. Kept in sync by
# `python/tests/test_release_metadata.py`, which fails the suite if they drift.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: LiPolGen
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-05"
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/Chao1009/PoliGen"
abstract: >-
  Doubly polarized e + 6Li / 7Li DIS event generator for the EIC: a C++17
  spin-density kernel and cluster-spectator sampler, stock PYTHIA 8 as the
  hadronizer (through LHAup), HepMC3 output, and pybind11 Python bindings.
authors:
  - name: "<AUTHOR NAME — to be filled by the author>"
